AR-022 scale attempt

The first invocation requested groups_per_matchup=2 across four deck strata
(eight sibling groups total). It produced only partial bounded bundle files
before the harness window ended and did not produce a candidate or manifest.
The experiment was rerun with groups_per_matchup=1 across the same four strata;
that bounded run completed and supersedes the partial files in this directory.
No candidate from the partial attempt was evaluated or promoted.
